# No install scripts (plan 3.1). The only dependency with one is the SQLite
# driver, better-sqlite3-multiple-ciphers, whose implicit `node-gyp rebuild`
# needs a C++ toolchain only to find that a prebuilt binary is already there.
# Where node-gyp cannot find one (CI's windows-latest), the step fails and npm
# drops the optional package without a word. The prebuilds cover Windows and
# Linux on x64 and arm64. A dependency that truly needs a build step must
# say so here and change this.
ignore-scripts=true
